":0.8,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Correct the dispatch-breadth framing: state that g2p dispatches gerrit-scanner-verify.yml on every patchset (route-agnostic) and on `recheck`, and confirm the advisory lane self-scopes (e.g. no-op on docs-only) rather than relying on route filtering it does not receive.","cohort":["G1G2"],"criteria":["G1G2"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.602,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["infra/gerrit/gerrit_to_platform.ini.template lines 16-22: 'g2p does NOT branch-filter dispatch … the event->workflow mapping is filename-substring based … with NO branch/ref allowlist', and patchset_created.py does 'unconditional find_and_dispatch(project,\"verify\",inputs)'","gerrit_to_platform.ini.template line 12-13 + [mapping \"comment-added\"] recheck = verify: a `recheck` comment re-dispatches every `verify`-matching workflow","gerrit-verify.yaml itself gates docs-only vs full ROUTE internally (classify job), but g2p selects the whole file by filename regardless of route"],"finding":"The plan describes the advisory scanner lane as running for 'full-route Gerrit runs' / 'patchset events', but the verified g2p dispatch filter is route-agnostic and recheck-triggerable, so the lane will fire on every patchset (including docs-only) and on every `recheck` comment, not just full-route events.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f3c550c5f7123a0e5","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Advisory wiring constraint / Testing ('present for full-route Gerrit runs')","norm_id":"na8fc767b599a6e2a","priority":0.198,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A docs-only patchset dispatches the scanner lane even though gerrit-verify.yaml would skip its full-route jobs","A `recheck` comment re-runs the scanner lane alongside the Verified re-run"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.75,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_